-async def readiness(*, database: str = DATABASE) -> dict[str, Any]:
-    """Every organization's readiness, measured now (the server's own read of the door).
-
-    Runs under its own bounded statement clock (``READINESS_STATEMENT_TIMEOUT_MS``), set on this
-    side the way the press sets its own: the role's 30 s ceiling would otherwise cut the read on a
