-"""COPY AGAIN — the person's own door to the mover's rerun (lane COPY-AGAIN-DOOR, 2026-09-25).
-
-THE DEFECT IT CLOSES (the door law). The Data tables switch on an organization's settings page
-names what would differ if the owner pressed it now — "1 colour differs … Copying again brings the
-older table's colours" — and until this lane the only control beside that sentence re-measured it.
-Copying again was a terminal command agents ran (``runner --move --organization <id>``). This module
-is that same rerun, callable for ONE organization or ONE of its tables by a signed-in person who
-owns or administers it, with every refusal said in a sentence.
-
-WHAT IT RUNS. Exactly the mover's COPY (``move_one_organization(..., apply=True)``):
-additive, idempotent (same ids, never a duplicate), and safe while the switch is off — the older
-table is untouched, nothing is archived, no setting moves, and a person's visible test edit on the
-copy stays (the rerun refreshes the kept pre-image the switch puts back, never the edit;
-lane COPY-WRITABLE). Nothing new is decided here; this is who may ask, and the one-line result.
-
-WHAT IT REFUSES, BEFORE ANYTHING IS WRITTEN (``CopyAgainRefused.reason``):
-
-* ``not_signed_in`` — no person.
-* ``not_yours`` — no such organization or table that this person belongs to.
-* ``not_owner`` — a member who is not an owner or administrator of the organization.
-* ``organization_archived`` — the organization is archived: membership reaches nothing inside it
-  (ACCESS LADDER T-33) until it is restored.
-* ``switched`` — the organization pressed its Data tables switch: its tables live in the new system,
-  so there is no older table to copy from.
-* ``archived`` — the one table asked for is archived on the older side.
-
-"The mover is busy" is the MOVER's to say (lane MOVER-CARRY-TAILS, 2026-09-26): every writing run
-holds the organization's claim (:mod:`matrx_records.movers.claim`), so a press while an agent's
-terminal rerun is copying the same organization is refused with
-:class:`~matrx_records.movers.move.MoverBusyRefused` naming who holds it, and nothing is started.
-
-The ORGANIZATION IS READ FROM THE OBJECT for a single table (access is personal; the active
-organization never decides which organization a table belongs to).
-"""
